FLUS Console — Cross-platform Edition
=====================================

This repository contains a port of the FLUS (Future Land Use Simulation)
console source code to a cross-platform build (CMake + standard C++14),
based on the original Windows / Visual Studio source distribution released
by the GeoSOS team at Sun Yat-sen University.


