Cross-platform port (this repository)
-------------------------------------
The CMake build scripts, vcpkg manifest, the platform_compat.h shim, and
the minimal source edits required to remove Windows-only constructs
(windows.h, _tmain, _TCHAR, GetTickCount, <strstream>, stdafx.h) are
provided as-is, with no algorithmic changes to the FLUS model.

This port is offered under the same non-commercial academic research
terms that apply to the upstream FLUS source it derives from. It does
not, and cannot, grant any additional license to the underlying FLUS
source code or the ALGLIB code.
